Judge speed in a production build (`pnpm --filter @visonaut/lab build`, then `vite preview`). For a design session in dev, an own `src/client.tsx` without StrictMode cuts the next frame by 18 to 38%:

```tsx
startTransition(() => {
  hydrateRoot(document, <StartClient />);
});
```

The cost is the loss of the StrictMode checks.
